{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"aaron-himelstein","name":"Aaron Himelstein","birthDate":"1985-10-10","birthPlace":"Buffalo Grove, Illinois, USA","bio":"Aaron Himelstein (born October 10, 1985) is an American actor. He is perhaps best known for playing a younger version of Austin Powers in Austin Powers in Goldmember (2002) and Friedman in Joan of Arcadia (2003 - 2005). Other film appearances include High Fidelity (2000), Fast Food Nation (2006), Captain America: The Winter Soldier (2014), Avengers: Age of Ultron (2015), and Blink Twice (2024).  Himelstein has made guest appearances in numerous television series such as Cupid, Boston Public, North Shore, House, and Community. He also had a recurring voice role on The Legend of Korra (2013 - 2014) as Desna, the androgynous waterbending twin of Aubrey Plaza's character.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:37:45+00:00","tmdbId":43373,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/43373","credits":[{"id":"cap-winter","title":"Captain America: The Winter Soldier","character":"Launch Tech #1","characterFa":"راه اندازی فناوری شماره 1"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/aaron-himelstein.webp","filmography":[{"name":"M.R.I. (or, Michael Returns Indefinitely)","year":2025,"character":"Michael","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aaDyuKZEalkHI8fUYYGwKCWnr2L.jpg"},{"name":"Blink Twice","year":2024,"character":"Asshole Manager","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lZGOK0I2DJSRlEPNOAFTSNxSjDD.jpg"},{"name":"They Grow Up So Fast","year":2023,"character":"Marty (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jwA3xngH7KFILR3s5oiy0eEtC8h.jpg"},{"name":"Love, Death & Robots","year":2019,"character":"Rookie (voice)","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vL5BQvXH96cJzmNK5n7QliQxy90.jpg"},{"name":"The Shepherd","year":2017,"character":"Simon","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/q4yiNROo7yyGSe13pEWez5d7jci.jpg"},